{"language":"jp","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","丛林之怒"],["/skills/0/name_i18n/jp","森の怒り"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","被动地，自身获得可自动恢复的“树藤之护”护盾。主动释放时，持续挥舞大刀对面前的敌人造成伤害。"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/jp","パッシブ効果：自動でシールド値を回復する「守護のツル」シールドを獲得。アクティブ効果：大刀を振り回し続け、前方の敵にダメージを与える"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","被动地，战斗开始时自身失去70%的生命值，获得至多可抵御120% + 12% HP伤害的“树藤之护”护盾，“树藤之护”每秒自动恢复10% + 1% HP的护盾值，其存在时自身处于霸体状态。“树藤之护”被击破时，进入3秒的冷却，冷却结束后“树藤之护”护盾量直接恢复至45% HP。\n主动释放时，缇洛亚挥舞大刀8次，每次挥刀对前方2格扇形范围内敌人造成两次60% ATK伤害。期间获得70%减伤效果，且每受到4次伤害后使挥刀次数增加一次，至多挥刀12次。如果范围内没有敌人，会朝最近的敌人突进后继续挥刀。本技能的主动效果不受急速影响。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","パッシブ効果：戦闘開始時に70%のHPを失い、120% + 12% HP分の「守護のツル」シールドを獲得。「守護のツル」は毎秒、10% + 1% HPのシールド値を回復し、存在期間中、自身はスーパーアーマー状態になる。「守護のツル」は破壊されると3秒のCDに入り、CD終了後、シールド値を45% HPまで回復\nアクティブ効果：大刀を8回振り回し、1回につき、前方2マスの扇状範囲内の敵に60% ATKのダメージを2回与える。大刀を振り回す間、被ダメージ-70%、ダメージを4回受けるたびに、大刀を振る回数が1回分増加し、最大12回まで振り回せる。範囲内に敵がいない場合、最も近い敵に突進した後に刀を振り回す。このスキルのアクティブ効果は速度の影響を受けない"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":32,"end":38,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"},{"start":68,"end":73,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":27,"end":33,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"},{"start":67,"end":72,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":28,"end":41,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"},{"start":65,"end":76,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"},{"start":89,"end":91,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"},{"start":132,"end":138,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"},{"start":176,"end":183,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":23,"end":36,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"},{"start":64,"end":75,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"},{"start":95,"end":103,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"},{"start":144,"end":150,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"},{"start":193,"end":200,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","主动释放时，每次挥刀造成的伤害提升至65% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","振り回し攻撃1回ごとのダメージが65% ATKにUP"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":18,"end":25,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":16,"end":23,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","主动释放时，每次挥刀造成的伤害提升至70% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/jp","振り回し攻撃1回ごとのダメージが70% ATKにUP"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":18,"end":25,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":16,"end":23,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","主动释放时，每次挥刀造成的伤害提升至75% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/jp","振り回し攻撃1回ごとのダメージが75% ATKにUP"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":18,"end":25,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":16,"end":23,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","主动释放时，每次挥刀造成的伤害提升至80% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/jp","振り回し攻撃1回ごとのダメージが80% ATKにUP"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":18,"end":25,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":16,"end":23,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","猛力劈斩"],["/skills/1/name_i18n/jp","パワースラッシュ"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","对目标发起一次蓄力戳刺，并恢复“树藤之护”护盾。"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/jp","対象に強力な一撃を繰り出し、「守護のツル」のシールド値を回復"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","缇洛亚短暂蓄力后对当前目标发起一次强力攻击，造成220% ATK伤害，“树藤之护”存在时，还会回复实际伤害量160% + 15%的“树藤之护”护盾。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","力を溜めて、現在の攻撃対象に強力な一撃を繰り出し、220% ATKのダメージを与える。「守護のツル」が存在する場合、「守護のツル」のシールド値を実際に与えたダメージ×160% + 15%分回復"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":58,"end":64,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":87,"end":93,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":24,"end":32,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":25,"end":33,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","造成伤害提高至230% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","ダメージが230% ATKにUP"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":7,"end":15,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":5,"end":13,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","造成伤害提高至240% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/jp","ダメージが240% ATKにUP"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":7,"end":15,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":5,"end":13,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","造成伤害提高至250% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/jp","ダメージが250% ATKにUP"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":7,"end":15,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":5,"end":13,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","藤刃共鸣"],["/skills/2/name_i18n/jp","蔓刃共鳴"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","使大刀与植物产生共鸣，接下来一段时间内自身对敌人造成伤害时会附加基于自身护盾量的伤害。"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/jp","大刀と植物の共鳴により、一定時間の間、敵にダメージを与えた時、自身の残りのシールド値に応じて追加でダメージを与える"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","缇洛亚使大刀与植物产生共鸣，接下来10秒内对敌人造成伤害时，会额外附加自身当前护盾量6% + 1%的伤害，附加伤害至多不超过200% ATK。使用该技能时自身2格范围内每有1名友军，增益效果时间延长3.5秒。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","大刀と植物の共鳴により、10秒間、敵にダメージを与えた時、追加で自身の残りのシールド値×6% + 1%のダメージを与える。追加ダメージは200% ATKを超えない。このスキルの発動時に自身の周囲2マス以内にいる味方1体につき、バフ効果の持続時間が3.5秒延長される"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":44,"end":49,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":46,"end":51,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":62,"end":70,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":68,"end":76,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","附加伤害提升至自身当前护盾量的7% + 1%。"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","追加ダメージが自身の残りのシールド値×7% + 1%にUP"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":22,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":21,"end":26,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","附加伤害提升至自身当前护盾量的8% + 1%。"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/jp","追加ダメージが自身の残りのシールド値×8% + 1%にUP"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":22,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":21,"end":26,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","附加伤害提升至自身当前护盾量的9% + 1%。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/jp","追加ダメージが自身の残りのシールド値×9% + 1%にUP"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":22,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":21,"end":26,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/name_i18n/jp","天賦の才"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","提高自身受愈。"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/jp","自身の治癒UP"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的受愈提升11点。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","戦闘中、自身の治癒+11"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的受愈提升15点。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","戦闘中、自身の治癒+15"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的受愈提升19点。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/jp","戦闘中、自身の治癒+19"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","自然滋长"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/jp","成長の恵み"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","“树藤之护”被击破后，恢复的护盾量获得提升。"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/jp","「守護のツル」が破壊された後のシールド値の回復量UP"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","“树藤之护”首次被击破时，不再具有冷却时间，直接获得120% HP的护盾量。后续“树藤之护”被击破时，冷却期后的回复量提升至60% HP。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","「守護のツル」が初めて破壊された時、CDに入らず、直ちに120% HPのシールド値を獲得。2回目以降の「守護のツル」破壊の後、CD終了後のシールド値の回復量が60% HPにUP"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":26,"end":33,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"},{"start":62,"end":68,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"}]],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":28,"end":35,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"},{"start":79,"end":85,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"}]],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","“树藤之护”冷却期后的回复量提升至70% HP。"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","2回目以降の「守護のツル」破壊の後、CD終了後のシールド値の回復量が70% HPにUP"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":23,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"}]],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":34,"end":40,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"}]],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","“树藤之护”累计存在15秒后，增强与植物的共鸣，使处于自身2格范围内所有友军提升40%的最大生命值和60%护甲魔抗。友军通过本技能获得的最大生命值不超过缇洛亚自身初始最大生命值的80%。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/jp","「守護のツル」の累計存在時間が15秒に達すると、植物との共鳴が強化される：自身の周囲2マス以内にいる味方全体のHP上限+40%、物理・魔法防御+60%。味方がこのスキル効果により獲得するHP上限は、ティラヤの初期HP上限の80%を超えない"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","“树藤之护”冷却期后的回复量提升至80% HP。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/jp","2回目以降の「守護のツル」破壊の後、CD終了後のシールド値の回復量が80% HPにUP"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":23,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"}]],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":34,"end":40,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"}]],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/name_i18n/jp","覚醒の力"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","终极技能期间提升“树藤之护”的恢复速度。"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/jp","必殺技発動中、「守護のツル」のシールド値の毎秒回復量UP"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","终极技能期间，“树藤之护”恢复速度提升至每秒15% HP。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","必殺技発動中、「守護のツル」のシールド値の毎秒回復量が15% HPにUP"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":22,"end":28,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"}]],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":27,"end":33,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"}]],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","蔓织锋刀"],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/jp","バインブレイド"]]}